      "### Pure Rain: the ozonic just-cleaned note",
      "[Pure Rain](/scents/pure-rain) leans more ozonic and airy than Citrus Bloom — closer to the smell of a window cracked open after a storm than anything fruity or sweet. It's a great match for the \"just aired out the house\" feeling you're going for right after cleaning, especially in bathrooms and kitchens where you want the space to read as genuinely fresh rather than fragranced over. It also layers well underneath brighter top notes when you want more depth than a single citrus note provides.",
      "### Green Bamboo: a soft green finish",
