      "### Will HVAC scenting affect the service department or back-office areas too?",
      "Only if those areas share the same air handling zone as the showroom. Most dealerships have separate HVAC zones for showroom, service, and back-office space, so it's worth confirming zoning with your facilities contact before installation to make sure the scent reaches exactly the areas you intend and no others.",
      "### How is this different from just using an air freshener or scented HVAC filter?",
